'
' Technical context: external systems and protocols of Breakdown RS.

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam linetype ortho

cloud "Users\n(Web Browser)" as users
cloud "OIDC Identity\nProvider" as idp

together {
  rectangle "Breakdown RS API\n(Axum)" as api
  database "SierraDB\n(Event Store, RESP3)" as sierra
  database "PostgreSQL\n(Projections / Read Model)" as pg
  rectangle "Garage\n(S3 Object Store)" as garage
  database "Vault\n(Secrets)" as vault
  queue "AI Provider\n(LLM API)" as llm
}

users --> api : HTTPS / JSON (REST)
users .right.> idp : Login (OIDC)
api --> idp : JWKS validation
api --> sierra : RESP3 protocol
api --> pg : SQL (TLS in prod)
api --> garage : S3 API
api ..> vault : secrets fetch
api ..> llm : HTTPS (AI import queue)

note bottom of pg
  Read side: flat projection tables,
  updated asynchronously by projectors.
end note

note bottom of sierra
  Write side: immutable event streams,
  one stream per aggregate instance.
end note

@enduml
